      },
      "totalDuration": "2 yrs",
      "description": "Common Server Architecture team.\nBecame subject matter expert for SELinux in RHEL environments, created and supported external teams in creating local policy modules.\nSupported systems engineers in functional performance analysis. Responsible for the analysis of RHEL and Windows VMs deployed on vSphere ESXi on On-Prem servers.\nSponsored and co-led the creation of a load generation tool that took input from previous functional test performance data to generate a similar load on a varying hardware and virtual machine configuration.",
